@title Rotating the signing key

Do these in order; each step has an owner on the incident channel.

step Announce the window | by 14:00 | Post in #platform and the status page
step Issue the new key | by 15:00 | Keep the old key valid for 24 hours
step Roll the verifiers | in progress
step Revoke the old key | 2026-11-02
step Write the follow-up

! Steps without a deadline render with no chip.

1. Numbered lists keep their usual look.
2. They are not step cards.
